  vendorName: Alchemist Ryland
  offerText: Drink this foul-tasting serum. It costs a heavy purse, but it will inoculate
    you against the plague sweeping the lower districts..
  acceptResultText: You choke down the bitter sludge. Your stomach churns miserably,
    hoping it wasn't a scam.
  rejectResultText: You laugh at the snake-oil salesman. You keep your coin, feeling
    quite smart.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: The plague was entirely real! You wake up coughing violently,
    feverish, and regretting your stubborn pride.
